flowchart TD
 S[Sensor event] --> V{Permission and consent valid?}
 V -- no --> X[Reject and audit]
 V -- yes --> E[Validate and encrypt]
 E --> P[Persist durable outbox]
 P --> Q[WorkManager upload worker]
 Q --> C{Network battery Doze feasible?}
 C -- no --> D[Defer with constraints and backoff]
 D --> Q
 C -- yes --> U[Upload encrypted payload]
 U --> A{Authenticated server ACK?}
 A -- yes --> R[Commit ACK and advance cursor]
 A -- transient --> D
 A -- permanent --> F[Fail or quarantine]
 S --> N[Critical event classifier]
 N --> I[Explicit internal alert Intent]
 I --> T[Privacy-minimised notification]
 L[Logout or consent revoke] --> K[Cancel jobs and clear transient secrets]
